VirtualBox 7.2 guest integration and Xorg for validating the C9 installer
and SDDM login screen. This hardware profile is separate from the common
desktop and does not provide an alternate Mango compositor.

Mango graphical operation is not established for this VirtualBox profile:
the upstream SceneFX renderer requires DRM capabilities that the virtual
GPU may not provide. Desktop acceptance testing uses supported physical
Intel or AMD hardware.
